SA Skincure is an evening dermatology clinic in Nayapalli, Bhubaneswar. Referrals can be sent on WhatsApp to the clinic number; the For doctors page has a ready-made message.

## What to send

- The patient's name, age and contact number.
- The reason for referral and the treatment tried so far, with doses.
- Relevant reports, and clinical photos if the patient agrees.

